          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: il fianco",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il fianco — \"hip, side (of the body)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mi fa male il fianco destro. My right side hurts."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Di fianco a — beside: di fianco alla porta."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "fianco comes from Frankish hlanca \"side, hip\" (EtymDB), a Germanic word, probably through Old French flanc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
