              "text": "la coscia — \"thigh\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dopo la corsa mi fanno male le cosce. After the run my thighs hurt."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The plural is le cosce. In the kitchen: una coscia di pollo — a chicken leg."
            }
          ]
        },
